        <!-- Deliberately NOT covered here: account.journal and account.account.
             branch 1 owns no journals at all and posts through the parent's, so
             a strict rule on those would stop it invoicing rather than merely
             tidying what it can see. Accounting separation needs each branch to
             have its own journals first; that is a data change, not a rule. -->

    </data>

</odoo>
